  m_text: "<size=19>- Full Stacks of Jackpot symbols on reels 2, 3 and 4 triggers
    the Jackpot Bonus Games.\n- In the Jackpot Bonus, only gem symbols and blank symbols
    appear. \n- There is a Jackpot Wheel above each reel with different number of
    wedge slices.\n- If gem symbols appear in full stacks on any of the reels, one
    wedge slice will be activated on the wheel.\n- Reels, Jackpot Reward, Gem Symbols,
    and Wheel Wedges work as the following.\n"
