  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<size=18>- In Free Games, whenever user's chosen symbol appears in full
    stacks, trigger Hold & Re-Spin.\r\n- 1 Re-Spin will be given regardless of the
    number of full stacks that appeared.\r\n- All full stacks of the chosen symbol
    get locked on screen, while remaining reels re-spin.\r\n- If additional chosen
    symbols appear in full stacks, calculate line pay, lock the newest full stacks,
    and award \n  1 more Re-Spin. \r\n- Re-Spin feature ends when no additional chosen
    symbols appear in full stacks, or if the screen is full of the\n   chosen symbol.
    \r\n- During Free Games, if full stacks of Bonus symbols appear on reels 2, 3
    and 4, re-trigger Free Games and \n  award the same number of spins as initially
    awarded."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
